('node-3-21', 'phase-03-lesson-21-queue-applications-sliding-window-buffers', 'module-5', 21, 'Lesson 5.21: Queue Applications: Sliding Window Buffers', 'Prerequisites: Lesson 3.7, Lesson 3.16', 'Prerequisites: Lesson 3.7, Lesson 3.16 | Subtopics: 4 items', 'Systems project application', 160, 4, 750.0, 1050.0, '# Lesson 3.21: Queue Applications: Sliding Window Buffers

